Delay 34 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 34 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 34 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 34 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 34 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 34 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 34 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft\Gtm rage</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>